Z||000000||Formula||10-04-2000||08:45 PM||||ok....... I broke up with my gf a month or so ago, I had a post about it.  we agreed to just be friends and everything was cool. of course she started going out with a good friend of mine and I got jealous but kept my mouth shut because she has enough problems and doesnt need a jealous ex-bf,  but lately we are hanging out A LOT (except for last week and this week) everynight we hang out, we even go out on saturday nights and do bf-gf stuff, lately shes been talking about breaking up with the guy shes going out with now (my friend) and she gets jealous when I go out with other girls and she gets mad when I flirt, look, etc... when we are just hanging out....(btw her current bf never calls and completly ignores her)... so last week she was in a really bad mood for some reason and we got into a argument about being friends and how everyone talks about us because we hang out too much to just be friends... so I said maybe we shouldnt hang out anymore and eople would stop talking...then we didnt talk for a couple days and I emailed her something and she sent me back a emailing saying that shes just sick about everyone talking behind everyones back then other people telling me and me telling her etc.... so we didnt talk monday (I have late classes) then on tuesday I drove like 3 hours to buy her a big ee-ore (winnie the pooh charecter) stuffed animal, I know I spent a lot on it ($100) but she always said that she wanted one and I thought it would cheer her up........(this is a soap opera lol)...I called her on my cell phone and her mom answered and said she would call me back later...so I went to one of her friends houses to show her friend the stuffed animal (she is my best freinds gf).... so we call her and her sister broke her ankle so we have to go to her house for me to give her it....we went to her house, I put the ee-ore in a garbage bag and we go up to her bedroom.... I give it to her and she was saying that she cant accept it because it cost way too much....they tell me to leave the room so they can talk for a second and I assumed that she was saying she doesnt like me blah blah blah, but what she was really saying is that her parents dont even spend that much money on her and she cant accept it..... I was cool about it and her friend came up with the idea to let her sister keep it (just broke her ankle) until she could give me a hundred bucks for it (which I dont want because it was a gift) but I still agreed just to be nice...... then I left and the only thing that has happened since then was I sent her an email that said if she buys a fiero model and builds it for me then I will say its even and we will bothe be happy....... but she hasnt emailed me back and Im wondering if shes really frustrated that I did that... the one thing I dont understand is that being friends worked really good but we are both jealous and it doesnt go away... has this happened to anyone else here or am I just in a weird situation?  and what would be some advice to get her back if this is the way its going.  ||||reg||1
